    "authored_date": "2026-07-18",
    "deviation_notes": "Twin structure to caustic-arrow: two ground_targeted_circle cold-DoT pools + chill (water family), self-anchored Vortex-at-feet. Drift: PoE cold DoT is a fixed-tick DAMAGE-OVER-TIME pool scaled by DoT-multiplier with reapply-not-spam cadence; the engine carries 'cold DoT' via water + chill ailment + ground_targeted_circle, but the pure-DoT-uptime damage model is approximated (PERSISTENCE_ENGINE_uptime at capstone). The CI/ES-facetank safety identity is a def-bin/trait rider, not a geometry.",
    "grade": "CLOSE",
    "kit_id": "poe1-cold-dot-occ",
    "mapping_json": {
      "fidelity_notes": "Structurally near-twin of caustic-arrow: two ground_targeted_circle cold-DoT pools + chill, but self-anchored (Vortex at feet) rather than kited. cold -> water, chill native. The safest-league-starter identity lives in the DEFENSIVE chassis (CI/ES facetank while pools tick), which maps to def-bin/trait riders (Wicked Ward = ES-recharge-uninterrupted, Vile Bastion = ES-on-kill), NOT a geometry — noted in traits_affixes. Honest CLOSE (not EXACT), same nuance as caustic-arrow: PoE cold DoT is a fixed-tick DAMAGE-OVER-TIME pool; the engine expresses the cold-DoT via water-family + chill ailment + ground_targeted_circle, but the pure-DoT-uptime damage model (scale DoT-multiplier, reapply-not-spam) is a persistent-DoT pattern that PERSISTENCE_ENGINE_uptime captures at the capstone while the per-pool ailment is a chill approximation of the DoT tick. Vaal Cold Snap (mapping burst) + Wither totems route as variant/support flavor, noted.",
      "motion_frame": "facetank DoT-pool caster: drop Vortex at your feet + Creeping Frost pools, reapply periodically (not spam), let the CI/ES body eat hits while the cold pools tick",
